<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S6.SS0.SSS0.Px2" title="In 6 Experiment 3: How do embeddings change after linguistic features stabilize? ‣ Vocabulary embeddings organize linguistic structure early in language model training" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Correlation between input and output embeddings peaks with linguistic representations</span></a></li>
